flowchart TD
    Check[Readiness evaluation] --> Auth{Selected provider configured?}
    Auth -- no --> Block[Core readiness blocked]
    Auth -- yes --> Analysis{Confirmed provider analysis?}
    Analysis -- no --> Block
    Analysis -- yes --> Launcher{Both descriptors valid?}
    Launcher -- no --> Block
    Launcher -- yes --> Thumb{Thumbnail valid?}
    Thumb -- no --> Block
    Thumb -- yes --> Core{Core components and hashes valid?}
    Core -- no --> Block
    Core -- yes --> Ready[Core ready]
    Ready --> Codex{Codex selected?}
    Codex -- yes --> Open[Enable Open in Codex]
    Codex -- no --> Generic[Show selected-provider ready state]
    Optional[Optional workflow incomplete] -. does not block .-> Ready
    SuperEvents[workflow.super_events state] -. optional, non-blocking .-> Ready
    Link[Fixed HTTPS portrait link] -. informational only .-> Ready
